00:00:45.363 --> 00:00:47.598
U.S. SERVICE MEMBERS KILLED

00:00:46.063 --> 00:00:48.733
THAT DAY AFTER A SERIES OF

00:00:47.732 --> 00:00:50.534
MISTAKES ON WHAT IS NOW

00:00:48.866 --> 00:00:51.969
