INITIALLY THOUGHT TO HAVE

00:00:57.074 --> 00:01:01.979
BEEN FATALLY INJURED.

00:00:58.976 --> 00:01:02.747
CHAPMAN WAS LEFT BY THE

00:01:02.113 --> 00:01:04.415
