00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:11.422
NATION'S HIGHEST MEDAL FOR

00:01:11.255 --> 00:01:13.891
VALOR.

00:01:11.555 --> 00:01:15.025
&gt;&gt; WE KNOW NOW FROM THOSE

00:01:14.024 --> 00:01:15.993
PREDATOR FEEDS THAT JOHN

00:01:15.159 --> 00:01:17.128
CHAPMAN WAS NOT DEAD.

00:01:16.127 --> 00:01:19.263
HE GOT BACK UP.

00:01:17.261 --> 00:01:22.066
HE KEPT FIGHTING.

00:01:19.397 --> 00:01:22.400
HE KILLED ADDITIONAL ENEMY

00:01:22.199 --> 00:01:23.934
FORCES.

