&gt;&gt; FOR YEARS FORMER AIR

00:01:24.068 --> 00:01:26.670
FORCE SECRETARY DEBRA JAMES

00:01:25.536 --> 00:01:28.439
PUSHED FOR CHAPMAN'S AIR

00:01:26.804 --> 00:01:30.574
FORCE CROSS TO BE UPGRADED.

00:01:28.572 --> 00:01:32.176
&gt;&gt; HE PAVED THE WAY FOR A

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:34.578
SAFE -- THE SAFE ENTRY OF

00:01:33.077 --> 00:01:36.647
THE REINFORCING FORCES THAT

00:01:34.712 --> 00:01:38.015
WERE COMING IN TO

00:01:36.781 --> 00:01:40.217
FOLLOW-ONTO THE BATTLE.

00:01:38.149 --> 00:01:41.552
&gt;&gt; NEW EVIDENCE, THE RESULT

00:01:40.351 --> 00:01:43.287
OF IMPROVED TECHNOLOGY AND

00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:45.189
ANALYSIS OF IMAGES FED BACK

00:01:43.421 --> 00:01:47.658
FROM A DRONE FLYING ABOVE

00:01:45.322 --> 00:01:49.059
THE ATTACK SITE SUGGEST THAT

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:50.261
CHAPMAN FOUGHT ON FOR MORE

00:01:49.193 --> 00:01:50.728
THAN AN HOUR AFTER THE SEALS

00:01:50.394 --> 00:01:52.696
LEFT HIM.

00:01:50.861 --> 00:01:56.033
THE AIR FORCE DOES NOT BLAME

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:57.868
TEAM LEADER BRIT SLOVENSKI.

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:58.803
&gt;&gt; I THINK HE DID HIS

00:01:58.936 --> 00:02:02.273
