00:01:59.904 --> 00:02:03.808
&gt;&gt; FORMER ARMY DELTA FORCE

00:02:02.406 --> 00:02:05.009
OPERATOR JIM REESE WAS IN

00:02:03.941 --> 00:02:06.177
THE OPERATION CENTER IN

00:02:05.142 --> 00:02:06.577
AFGHANISTAN WATCHING THE

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.913
VIDEO LIVE.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:10.414
&gt;&gt; BEING PRIVY TO THOSE

00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:11.749
FEEDS THAT I WAS PRIVY TO

00:02:10.548 --> 00:02:14.452
DURING THE OPERATION THAT

00:02:11.882 --> 00:02:16.287
NIGHT, SEEING SOMEONE

00:02:14.585 --> 00:02:17.555
SHOOTING WHEN THOSE RANGERS

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:19.256
WERE COMING, IN YES, I

00:02:17.688 --> 00:02:21.058
BELIEVE CHAPMAN WAS ALIVE.

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:22.460
&gt;&gt; THE SEALS SAY THEY DID

00:02:21.192 --> 00:02:23.494
NOT KNOW CHAPMAN WAS ALIVE

00:02:22.593 --> 00:02:25.229
WHEN THEY RETREATED.

00:02:23.627 --> 00:02:26.464
&gt;&gt; I DO BELIEVE CHAPPY WAS

00:02:25.362 --> 00:02:28.632
FIGHTING UP THERE.

00:02:26.597 --> 00:02:30.034
HIS RESILIENCY, YOU KNOW, HE

00:02:28.766 --> 00:02:30.434
PROBABLY PASSED OUT

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:33.804
INITIALLY.

00:02:30.568 --> 00:02:33.037
CAGE PACK

00:02:33.037 --> 00:02:33.137
CAME PACK

00:02:33.137 --> 00:02:35.873
CAME BACK UP.

00:02:33.938 --> 00:02:36.807
WHAT CHAPMAN DID WAS ABOVE

00:02:36.006 --> 00:02:38.108
AND BEYOND BECAUSE HE WAS

00:02:36.941 --> 00:02:38.476
THE LAST ONE ON THE

